    "description": "Closed Mentalism 3.1 - Gas Manipulation. Spells for creating and dispelling fog, controlling air movement and walls of churning air, creating vacuums, warming and oxygenating air, and mastering clouds. Special Notes: (1) All vacuums created by spells on this list also create a loud noise. The larger the radius the louder the noise. The GM may wish to rule that all within the radius must make a second RR or be deafened for 1 round per 10 failure (RR attack level equals the radius of the vacuum). (2) An elemental creature made of a gas will be cut to 20% activity if attacked with an Air Stop spell (and the creature fits into the area of effect). A Vacuum spell cast upon an elemental creature made of gas will result in a Slaying Critical on the creature.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Condensation",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "1 cu' water",
          "duration": "P",
          "range": "touch",
          "type": "E",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Condenses 1 cubic foot of water from the surrounding air. Water condenses gradually into the caster's hands and may be funneled into any suitable receptacle."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "02. Warm Air",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 2,
          "area_of_effect": "1 cu'/lvl",
          "duration": "24 hr",
          "range": "touch",
          "type": "F",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Warms 1 cubic foot per level of air (any inanimate gas) up to 100°F above normal."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "03. Fog I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
